  "privacy.heading": "Before using this application, please read and accept the following privacy notice.",
  "privacy.body": "What data we store:\n• Full name\n• National ID number\n• Phone number\n• Date of birth\n• Optional photo\n• Optional notes\n• Subscription and attendance records\n• Payment records\n\nWhere data is stored:\nAll data is stored locally on this computer, in a private database. It is NOT sent to any server, cloud service, or third party.\n\nWhy we store it:\n• To identify each player during check-in\n• To manage subscriptions, sessions, and payments\n• To produce attendance and financial reports\n\nPlayers who are minors:\nIf the player is under 18, the parent or guardian must provide consent before the account is created.\n\nHow long we keep it:\nPlayer data is kept as long as the player is a member, and for a reasonable period afterwards for accounting and legal purposes.\n\nYour rights:\nYou may request to view, correct, or delete your personal data by contacting the academy administration.",
